{"overview":"ایزئی هیودو، دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی معمولی و شیطانی است که تنها آرزویش داشتن حارم شخصی است، اما او یکی از بدترین افراد در اطرافش است. او در اولین قرار خود با یک دختر می‌رود و فقط برای اینکه او در واقع یک فرشته سقوط کرده و خشن است، به‌طور وحشیانه مورد حمله و کشته می‌شود. در نهایت، او توسط سنپای زیبا و جذابش به‌عنوان شیطان بازتولد می‌یابد و او می‌گوید که او نیز شیطان است و اکنون استاد اوست! روزهای آرام او تمام شد. در نبردی بین شیطان‌ها و فرشتگان، چه کسی برنده خواهد شد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Issei Hyodo is your average perverted high school student whose one wish in life is to have his own harem, but he's got to be one of the unluckiest guys around. He goes on his first date with a girl only to get brutally attacked and killed when it turns out the girl is really a vicious fallen angel. To top it all off, he's later reincarnated as a devil by his gorgeous senpai who tells him that she is also a devil and now his master! One thing's for sure, his peaceful days are over. In a battle between devils and angels, who will win?","tagline_en":"Fueled by the fires of perversion!","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":18,"y":2011,"poster":"/3bOc7UuZssGF2UoyK7E6dz0SRr4.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2012,"poster":"/cdnweEnp50cgv2cSEj5JZH4M0Ld.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2013,"poster":"/uppXjs1CbiZXcROo7NJDELanzEC.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/pL07aFmuie5hWtvcPXWXhkNDz5B.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2018,"poster":"/pEQgXhHAR1MEnxCZEiU0mRKNlcs.jpg"}],"episodes":49,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"یوکی کاجی","role":"Issei Hyōdō (voice)","photo":"/8wKdPV11IwowfwoqGqMMNt9hmp6.jpg","en":"Yuki Kaji"},{"name":"یوکو هیکاسا","role":"Rias Gremory (voice)","photo":"/mP3bj0s1gqJ6tCKFLhu4b1CkJj7.jpg","en":"Yoko Hikasa"},{"name":"浅倉杏美","role":"Asia Argento (voice)","photo":"/wlajvPUtfHY5UAREHdd5uG5jyM3.jpg","en":"Azumi Asakura"},{"name":"伊藤静","role":"Akeno Himej